      "content": "Capsule is an online CRM for small and midsize businesses that manages contacts, sales pipelines, tasks, projects, and email integration. The v2 API is a REST/JSON service exposing parties (people and organisations), opportunities, projects, tasks, cases, users, and custom fields.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Capsule CRM Developer",
